unraid-vsock-sensors: Sends disk and HBA temperatures over AF_VSOCK.
unraid-vsock-sensors: Reads disk temperatures from Unraid's SMART cache.
unraid-vsock-sensors: Never queries disks directly; Unraid owns SMART polling.
unraid-vsock-sensors: Proxmox exposes them as native hwmon sensors.
